title: "PHI-SWARM: Physics-Hybrid Integrity Framework for Secure Autonomous UAV Swarms"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bello
    given-names: S. M.
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sm-bello/PHI-SWARM"
abstract: >-
  Software L0–L9 framework for integrity-gated federated PHM on multi-UAV
  swarms. Physics-twin data stays local; only signed weight deltas are
  exchanged. Reproducible validation suite. No flight or HIL claims.
keywords:
